    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFindFamili]{Find Familiar} spell and can cast it as a Magic action without expending a spell slot. When you cast it, you summon a Fel Imp familiar.</p><p>In addition, when you take the Attack action, you can forgo one of your own attacks to let your familiar make one attack with its Reaction.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Iz0ktydvVHD4Znq8\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The Fel Imp stat block is in D&D: World of Warcraft; use an Imp or the familiar of your choice.</p></section>",
